动："},{"type":"math","value":"Ee = Bev_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n圆周运动半径："},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}=\\frac{mv_{1}}{eB}=3R"},{"type":"text","value":"轨迹与圆筒外切："},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos \\alpha = \\frac{2R}{3R + R} = \\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow \\alpha = 60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n轨迹与圆筒内切："},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = \\alpha +180^{\\circ} = 240^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n（注：用弧度制表示"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha=\\frac{\\pi}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=\\frac{4\\pi}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，同样得分）\n②沿磁场方向速度分量："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=\\sqrt{v_{m}^{2}-v_{1}^{2}}=4\\sqrt{\\frac{W_{0}}{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"在区域I直线运动分运动时间："},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=\\frac{R}{v_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n圆周分运动与圆筒相切："},{"type":"math","value":"t_2 = \\frac{150^\\circ}{360^\\circ}\\times \\frac{2\\pi\\cdot 3R}{v_1}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow x _ {\\mathrm{m}} = v _ {2} \\times (t _ {1} + t _ {2}) = \\frac {4}{3} R + \\frac {1 0}{3} \\pi R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(1分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/79ab37e1a1e17a6efd0e8f610c41440a883b4f9f7200a3f716b4afe03021a3c7.png","width":220,"height":386,"width_mm":27.8},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a06dd4198e933d91fbf8bbb8cd764c9cd49ae546d9c7367f156a093e059081ed.png","width":189,"height":194,"width_mm":23.9},{"type":"figure","src":"images/375ba5d1b9187510c25e8f969508b86535eb89dc6703ca6e204d55c14531dca8.png","width":262,"height":347,"width_mm":33.1},{"type":"text","value":"（注：沿磁场方向速度分量"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=\\sqrt{v_{m}^{2}-v_{1}^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得1分；"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=\\frac{150^{\\circ}}{360^{\\circ}}\\times\\frac{2\\pi m}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"也可得1分；给出"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{m}=\\frac{4}{3}R+\\frac{10}{3}\\pi R"},{"type":"text","value":"结果才能得1分）"}]}}]}
